# NDH Agency — environment variables
#
# This app currently has NO backend (see AUDIT_REPORT.md) — auth, "database",
# and workflow state all live in the browser (localStorage). The only
# variable actually read today is the Paystack sandbox public key used by the
# demo payment modal. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values
# for local development; never commit a real `.env.local`.

# Paystack PUBLIC key only (never put a secret key in client-side env vars —
# Vite inlines VITE_* variables into the shipped JS bundle for anyone to
# read). Get a test key from https://dashboard.paystack.com/#/settings/developer
VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
